  date: 20:40
  bodyEn: 'Hi. You left your coat and your keys in the governor''s office. I''ll
    keep them in my drawer until you''re back.


    I hope it''s not cold where
    you are.


    Good luck.

    Mary'
  bodyPt: "Oi. Voc\xEA esqueceu o casaco e as chaves no gabinete do governador. Vou
